Render the cinematic camera at internal OpenGL scale and sync captures on resize.

Adds GlCinematic so OpenGL/Compute upscaling renders the recentered 3D world,
screen-space 3D UI, and non-bitmap 2D foreground overlays at (256 * scale) x
(192 * scale) instead of falling back to 1x software without 2D overlays.
Also recreates the GL renderer when scale changes so VRAM captures are synced
and 3D/2D caches redraw immediately even on a repeated 3D frame.

